cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "GA-XAI: A Benchmark of Metaheuristic and Classical Feature Selection for Clinical Machine Learning"
version: 2.0.0
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - family-names: Mulugeta
    given-names: Metasebiya
    affiliation: Addis Ababa University
  - family-names: Gizachew
    given-names: Beakal
    affiliation: Addis Ababa University
repository-code: "https://github.com/Metasebiya-21/metaheuristic_xai_feature"
abstract: >-
  Code and results for the corrected, leakage-controlled GA-XAI benchmark of
  metaheuristic, explainability-based and classical feature selection
  (5 datasets, 5 classifiers, 11 methods, 5 seeds, 1,375 runs), together with
  the parameter-robustness sweep, convergence analysis and WDBC feature-agreement
  analysis reported in the paper.
keywords:
  - feature selection
  - metaheuristics
  - explainable AI
  - SHAP
  - benchmark
  - data leakage
